//~ FLICK-E002 @13:22-13:41 the signature of `read_random` does not allow service `Random`
//~ FLICK-E002 @16:25-16:47 the signature of `read_arguments` does not allow service `Arguments`
//~ FLICK-E002 @19:26-19:55 the signature of `write_console` does not allow service `Console`
